        "channelId": "UCyNh1mOCVsQ90_oTffjfsLg",
        "title": "The Molasses Disaster Was No Accident | Dark Chapters",
        "description": "On January 15, 1919, a fifty-foot tank of molasses burst in Boston's North End — killing 21 people. It was not an accident: the steel was half as thick as it needed to be, the builder skipped the safety tests, and every warning was ignored for years.\n\nCHAPTERS:\n00:00 The Wave That Was No Accident\n00:33 Boston, 1919\n00:58 Chapter 1: Boston, 1919\n02:23 Chapter 2: The Tank\n03:44 Chapter 3: The Wave\n07:18 Chapter 4: The Aftermath\n10:34 Chapter 5: The Memorial\n\nDark Chapters tells history's darkest true stories — disasters, mysteries and cover-ups they never taught you. New documentary every day.\n\nSpot an error? Let us know in the comments — we correct mistakes.",
