        "publishedAt": "2026-10-08T16:57:39Z",
        "channelId": "UCyNh1mOCVsQ90_oTffjfsLg",
        "title": "The Secret Army Trained to Die | Dark Chapters",
        "description": "In the summer of 1940, Winston Churchill built a secret army of 3,500 farmers and gamekeepers, hid them in underground bunkers across Britain — and gave them twelve days to live.\n\nThey were called the Auxiliary Units: Britain's stay-behind guerrilla force, trained in assassination and sabotage, ordered to let the Nazi invasion roll over their heads and then crawl out at night to kill. Their life expectancy was twelve days. If capture seemed likely, they were ordered to kill themselves. The invasion never came — and they kept the secret for decades.\n\nCHAPTERS:\n00:00 The Army That Was Trained to Die\n00:27 Britain's Secret Army\n00:53 Chapter 1: The Darkest Hour\n02:39 Chapter 2: The Recruits\n04:35 Chapter 3: The Underground\n06:58 Chapter 4: The Stand-Down\n08:08 Chapter 5: The Secret\n\nDark Chapters tells history's darkest true stories — disasters, mysteries and cover-ups they never taught you. New documentary every day.",
